Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,先取得你父亲的同意解除婚约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gain your father's approval to dissolve your marriage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,再带着你湿漉漉的身子来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and find me as wet with desire as you now stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.05,0:00:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你有意娶我的爱女 我很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}News of your desires to his loving daughter lifts heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.55,0:00:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,按计划拿掉累赘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remove encumberance as discussed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.69,0:00:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你要打掉亲骨肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll see your child never born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.71,0:00:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是必要的牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A necessary thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有个红色的小药瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a red vial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.49,0:00:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你把里面的东西换成苦草和水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd see its contents replaced with water and bitter herb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,您妻子的奴隶晚上偷偷摸摸地进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife's slave stealing through the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.35,0:00:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,她手里拿的东西我很熟悉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In her hand, a thing familiar to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know what I hold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也知道你要它做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the intent it carries!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让他们今晚就倒在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let these men not fall here tonight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.17,0:00:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们去角斗场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去卡普亚的竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are for the arena in Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有请甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I give you Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于在竞技场上见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We had last faced each other upon the sands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.70,0:00:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,正如梅莉塔所害怕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as Melitta always feared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟她上床了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you lay with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenomaus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要用一腔热血扫荡八方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will cover this land in passion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,直到罗马帝国灰飞烟灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until Rome falls as a cinder, to scorch brow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:01:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,盖尤斯 我父亲呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gaius, where is my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.72,0:01:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了 死于斯巴达克斯之手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has fallen at the hands of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,《抉择》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们活着回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They live!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,快把药拿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get the Medicine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,给伤员包扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get cloth to tend wounds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.89,0:01:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,战果如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What news?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,竞技场已被烧为灰烬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The arena is burned to fucking ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.45,0:01:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,顺带着送了不少罗马人上西天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With many Romans among the ashes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,莱斯克斯呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of Rhaskos?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他死得很光荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He fell as all men should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,手里拿着剑 杀到牺牲为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With sword in hand and blood upon his thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你没受伤吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You suffer no wound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是诸神照顾我 小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods favor me, little man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.40,0:01:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你再这么叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call me that again...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神就该惩罚你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and they shall turn from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:01:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还有救吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can he be healed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,纳西尔只有一处伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nasir had but a single wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他的伤势恐怕无力回天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This man beyond what should warrant life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.25,0:02:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他是奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His name is Oenomaus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.15,0:02:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是寻常人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he is more than common man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿诸神也如此看重他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let pray the gods hold him in equal esteem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在做梦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do I yet dream?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是梦 我情愿你长睡不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If so, I would never have you wake...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.85,0:02:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,整个竞技场开始坍塌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then it began to collapse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.18,0:02:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,大火中的人像小孩子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They screamed and flailed like children{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:02:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,哭天喊地 六神无主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the arena burned around them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,浓烟和死亡的味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The scent of smoke and death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,随风飘到了罗马的最中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}carried by the winds to the very heart of Rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.49,0:03:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lift troubled heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.91,0:03:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯铁骨钢筋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenomaus stands a titan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.11,0:03:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一定能挺过来继续战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that shall live to raise sword again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,与你并肩作战吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To fight by your side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.17,0:03:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,只要他支持我们反抗罗马的志愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he chooses to take up cause against the Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.84,0:03:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的志愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你是天神下凡吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have cock to rival Jupiter himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你这一帮叛逃的奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A few errant slaves amounts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,根本就是乌合之众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to flies circling a bull's ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他是不是忘了竞技场砸到他头顶上的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did he miss the part where we pulled the arena down on his head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马可比那几根破柱子结实多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rome is propped up by more than a few wooden beams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们的志愿是少活几年的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If your cause is to see your lives cut short,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那你们离成功不远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then you march towards certain victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你这么想 为什么还要选择帮我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did you choose to aid us, if you believe such?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你搞错了 我是来还债的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mistake choice for repayment of a debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我欠奥诺玛默斯一笔债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One owed to Oenomaus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.26,0:03:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,否则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absent it,...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:04:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本不会在这儿跟你废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we would not be breaking words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.25,0:04:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,根本就不该相信他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To have placed faith in his intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,纳西尔也想过要我的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nasir once made attempt on my life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但他现在值得我们信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and yet now he stands trusted among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.35,0:04:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定甘尼克斯也能改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps Gannicus can be swayed as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.93,0:04:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你在竞技场里就应该杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or perhaps you should have killed him in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马的证人证明遗产的内容为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The witnesses in Rome also attest the will grants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马的家族住所和卡普亚的宅邸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the family domicile in Rome and the villa here in Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还有阿泰拉的葡萄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In addition there is the vineyard in Atella,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.62,0:04:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,庞贝山里的四十头羊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}forty goats in the hills of Pompeii,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,二十头牛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}twenty head of cattle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那些牲口总共值多少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is the worth of the livestock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,取决于买卖契约 大概值九千第纳尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nine thousand denarii, depending upon deal struck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到市场上卖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See them to market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.75,0:04:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,所得的钱用来悬赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And post decree announcing reward of the coin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,能提供斯巴达克斯线索的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for knowledge leading to the capture of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.48,0:05:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧 民政官大人 按照法律规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me, Praetor, but the law grants you no such authority{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,您无权处置这些财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to part with these assets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.66,0:05:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,您只能监管阿比努斯元老的遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are only to oversee Senator Albinius' holdings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,直到他的继承人成年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until his heir comes of age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,只要让斯巴达克斯落网伏法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Laws must bend toward greater purpose,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,法律也要酌情改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if Spartacus is to pay for what he has done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,民政官大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praetor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你的这些废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Prattling on serves only to inflict{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是在伤口上撒盐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}further wound on grieving heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.27,0:05:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会永远铭记您的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The memory of your father shall not soon fade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,整个共和国都哀悼他的逝去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All the Republic mourns his loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟哪一样让你更伤心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What moves your tears most?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,永远失去了父亲的疼爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A father forever removed from loving embrace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还是他再也不能开口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or his tongue forever stilled,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,同意解除我们的婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before commanding to dissolve this marriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好让你嫁给瓦里留斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in favor of Varinius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我犯下了天大的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have made a grave mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.85,0:06:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神才会如此惩罚我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the gods have punished me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,让我的父亲死于非命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by striking down my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这样还不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,盖尤斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gaius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.46,0:06:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你腹中的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only reason you have not joined{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你早就去九泉下和你父亲团聚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your father is the child that grows within you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的孩子 我的继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My child. My heir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.26,0:06:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你要拿命保护他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Protect him with your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我就要你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or see it forfeit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,按规矩 这几天还是要表现出哀悼的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must keep appearance of mourning for the prescribed days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不能因为伤心就什么都不顾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have the stench of grief slick upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,去洗干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See yourself to a bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,又在竞技场里找到一百来具尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A hundred more bodies pulled from the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,废墟里还有这个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This was found at wreckage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么就剩这么几个士兵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do our numbers stand so few?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,正从那不勒斯调更多人过来 天黑才能到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More have been recalled from Neapolis, to return by nightfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.26,0:07:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还有的已经不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet many have taken to the wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人是要背弃效忠罗马的誓言吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They turn from their oath to Rome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这里人心惶惶 我们的人也不例外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fear and panic grip the region, and our men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们相信斯巴达克斯招来了众神之怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many believe that Spartacus unleashes the wrath of the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A meaningless thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.61,0:07:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,加强军力并非难事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Legions could return to swell rank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但休想打败斯巴达克斯那帮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet still fall to Spartacus and his men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,说来抱歉 马科斯死之前我曾警告过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, but as I warned young Marcus before life fled,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,角斗士绝对不是普通的奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}gladiators are far from common slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你手下三名士兵打不过一个角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Three of your men would not equal one so trained,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这种行为纯属找死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}despite their eagerness to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.78,0:08:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前也是他们当中的一员吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you not once stand amongst the brotherhood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.63,0:08:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,算个角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon the sands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A lifetime ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那就展示一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then give lesson,...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.33,0:08:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,让大家开开眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}prove boast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这叙利亚人敢情是想尝尝苦头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Syrian wants to taste his own blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.49,0:09:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么不动 打呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the matter? Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,来呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们向来认为 我是角斗士当中最差劲的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I was considered lowest among the brotherhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,莫非我要照你的样子建立一支军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that I had an army formed in your base image.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,像我这样的人不难找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are others that share my reflection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.45,0:10:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们貌似常人 其实是狂暴的野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Men in name only, a word masking truer nature of rabid animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,眼下时局艰难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such a force under my guidance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,由我指挥这样的军队 肯定能成气候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}could prove useful in these difficult times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,元老院肯定不能接受身份如此低贱的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Senate would frown upon lowering standard into muck and shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.97,0:11:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,正如他们不懂什么叫做不择手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As they frown upon many things that ambitious men must embrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.08,0:11:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You leave these walls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是民政官的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At request of the praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他的提携是我阿舒尔应得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He blesses Ashur with well deserved favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.07,0:11:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他伤心欲绝的妻子怎么就突然失宠了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that he turn such grace toward grieving wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,丧父之痛 确实难以承受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a hard thing, to have a father torn from breast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:11:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道我父亲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never knew mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,葛雷博怎么知道伊莉西娅房里的松香草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did Glaber come to know of the silphium in Ilithyia's chambers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没准是诸神告诉他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps the gods spoke to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘了你的地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You forget your place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我保住了地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I secure it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.61,0:12:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没有我 你什么都保不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You secure nothing without me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,低贱的叙利亚人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you fucking Syrian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是再敢违抗我的命令…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move against my commands again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,谁还听你的狗屁命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You command shit and piss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我是葛雷博的手下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am Glaber's man now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.97,0:12:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我告诉他你知道伊莉西娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A word from me how you knew of his wife's intent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,想打掉他亲生骨肉的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to rob him of his unborn child...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,或者送来奥诺玛默斯根本不关诸神的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or how the gods are nothing to do with delivering Oenomaus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在还能活命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You yet draw breath{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为我没有把这些秘密透露给民政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because I have not whispered your secrets into the praetor's ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:12:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不 阿舒尔 阿舒尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, Ashur. Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,只当是好心帮忙吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Consider it a kindness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我迟早会报答你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One I shall see repaid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,疼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does it hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一点皮肉小伤而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A few cuts and scrapes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就能忘掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon faded from memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.23,0:13:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不是所有伤口都那么容易愈合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that all scars were so easily erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.54,0:13:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒没看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see no scars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是不顾一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You risked all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.31,0:13:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可你救回来的女人只有曾经的影子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For pale shadow of the woman you once loved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.40,0:13:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就燃起火焰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then let us ignite the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.91,0:13:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,用太阳的温暖驱散阴影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And strike darkness with its warmth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们夺走了我的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have taken everything from me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至你轻抚我的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even your touch...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.93,0:15:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说了很多你在竞技场的传奇故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have heard tales of your victories in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.18,0:15:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Days long past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,米拉说你当时就在竞技场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mira tells you were just upon its sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,代表罗马给他们行刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Standing as executioner for the Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是为了兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stood for a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.31,0:15:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,希望他体面地死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See him to an honorable death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,莱斯克斯呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Rhaskos?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他死的时候呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did he find the same?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟他有交情吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man held some meaning to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他给我地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He elevated position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我给他暖床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gave comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你们的交易是到头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It appears that bargain has come to an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那就另找别人嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see another struck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.95,0:16:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,找一个比他更厉害的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With a man of greater worth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我在他们当中没有地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hold no position among these men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,也没这个兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor do I seek it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.90,0:16:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,可你现在跟他们在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you stand among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想跟老朋友讲两句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I seek only words with an old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,仅此而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就在这里 维苏威的附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are here, in the shadow of Vesuvius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.11,0:16:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在山顶安排一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A single man placed upon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:17:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,周围数英里的情况就能尽收眼底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}its crest would have clear view for many miles in all direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易观察罗马人的动向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A Roman advance easily spotted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有上山的路吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there a way to its peak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A single path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,很窄 但是好走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Narrow, but easily tread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.66,0:17:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别的地方全是岩石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rest is sheer rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,除非长翅膀 否则不能走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Impassable, absent wings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.73,0:17:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们挑三个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will choose three men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有丰富的战斗经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of years beyond the taking up of sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,每人守一个岗哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Each to command a separate watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,到神庙来只有一条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's but one entrance to the temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人很容易困住我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Romans could easily trap us inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们脚底下有地道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tunnels extend below our feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.47,0:17:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也许可以挖一条出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps one can be dug beyond these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.72,0:17:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果打通了路 几个弓箭手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A few men with bows would give the Romans pause{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就足以拖住罗马人一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}long enough to make use of it, if walkway were built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有几个练过射箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many among you shoot with purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,竞技场很少有射箭的需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is not much call for arrows in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们如今不是在竞技场战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You no longer fight upon the sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,而且拿一棵该死的树可造不出刀剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor can you forge a sword from a fucking tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就用现有的材料造兵器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we will fashion weapons from what nature provides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有经验的人可以指导用法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With practiced hand instructing in their use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,训练到死有什么用呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can train until the gods take us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,打杂的奴隶不可能成为角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}House slaves will never be gladiators,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们缺的正是能打仗的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}something we are in short supply of now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need fighting men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也许该重新考虑那不勒斯的计划了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it is time to revisit plans towards Neapolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.41,0:18:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,目标是运送战俘的奴隶商船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And its slaver ships from foreign wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.02,0:18:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你要攻打港口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would attack the port?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.22,0:18:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么几个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With so few men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们火烧竞技场的时候人更少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We brought the arena down with less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,带两个人和所有的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take two men and what coin we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.81,0:18:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在那不勒斯买通了人 就知道商船何时靠岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Weight palm in Neapolis to loosen tongue of ships soon to dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我无意打扰你们的谈话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not intend to halt conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,除非那地图能当酒喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unless I can drink that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.77,0:18:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我对它毫无兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it holds no worth to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.29,0:18:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想找酒喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I seek only wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这儿没酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么破烂地方啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I truly am among the damned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,伺候你们两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For both of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我是妓女 又不是傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm a whore. Not a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,能聊聊吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.51,0:19:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,聊你妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck your words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是在跟你说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not with you that I seek them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.95,0:20:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个活儿想找你干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have an offer to discuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,刚好可以发挥你的特长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One suited to your particular talents...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.15,0:20:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为这些天你要守孝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not think you would need the bath,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.11,0:20:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,就不会来洗澡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with days of mourning yet left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.45,0:20:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我夫君命令我来洗 尽管有悖礼数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My husband commands it, despite tradition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,留下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你陪着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have your company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.60,0:21:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你的眼睛刚刚哭过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eyes betray recent tears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这些事情压在心里太沉重了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Events weigh heavy on the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真是让人心如刀绞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the point of crushing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么诸神没有警告斯巴达克斯的袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did the gods not warn of Spartacus' attack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是我父亲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or of my father's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.55,0:21:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神是在惩罚我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do they punish me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.24,0:21:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我打算除掉的小生命…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A life, for the one I had planned to take...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.42,0:21:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都要为自己的行为负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We both carry the burden of our acts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如果诸神要抛弃我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If the gods have cast us adrift,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须一起寻找出路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we must together discover the course{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.15,0:21:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,重新获得神明的庇佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to return to the blessing of their shores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.21,0:21:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯抛弃了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varinius has turned from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.75,0:21:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,盖尤斯又…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gaius...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.55,0:21:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕诸神也不能消除他对我的恨意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear not even the gods could sway his hatred of me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你要做出贤妻良母的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Resume appearance of loving wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.92,0:21:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,顺他心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Submit to his will...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:22:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天他会对你回心转意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The day will come when he will lose sight of hateful intention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.02,0:22:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是转瞬即逝的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A slip, however fleeting,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.87,0:22:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都要牢牢地把握住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we shall take advantage of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was a time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.55,0:22:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我做梦都想把你亲手掐死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when all I dreamt of was your throat beneath my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.30,0:22:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你却是我活下去的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now your breath is all that gives me life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.43,0:22:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远不会离开你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall not be moved from your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.39,0:22:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我的亡夫召唤我与他相聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until my own husband calls me to the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.84,0:23:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过你这样的眼神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have seen that look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.10,0:23:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还在巴蒂塔斯家时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It often fell upon me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.02,0:23:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你就经常这么看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when we were yet beneath Batiatus' roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.23,0:23:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在我到巴蒂塔斯家之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You knew Gannicus there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你就认识甘尼克斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}years before my arrival...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他是什么样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is your opinion of the man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.24,0:23:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他是冠军 就跟我们以前一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is a champion, as we once stood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.33,0:23:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有他加盟再好不过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A boon to your cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不过他对我们的行为表示怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has expressed doubts towards it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.71,0:23:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都怀疑过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As have we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.54,0:23:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,而你总有办法化解我们的疑虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet you always find way to convince otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.41,0:23:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们做到了不可能做到的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have done the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们摧毁了卡普亚的竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have brought down the arena in Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.18,0:23:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,摧毁了一座罗马压榨奴隶的纪念碑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A monument of Rome built upon the backs of slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.44,0:23:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在敌人的心脏上狠狠地插了一刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have struck a deep blow to the very heart of our enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:24:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 他们人多势众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet their numbers are vast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.57,0:24:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们渴望肆无忌惮地粉碎自由的呼声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As vast as their desire to see freedom crushed beneath heel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.65,0:24:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天 或许很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One day, perhaps soon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.18,0:24:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就会反击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they will strike back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.01,0:24:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们往哪儿逃啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do we avoid them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.67,0:24:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再躲躲藏藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not intend to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.32,0:24:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,能怎么办 是真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How? Is that true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.06,0:24:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们终究要面对罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we are to face the might of Rome,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.54,0:24:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那就在这儿决战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would do it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.94,0:24:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就在维苏威的背面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the shadow of Vesuvius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.70,0:24:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,按我们的规则来打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Upon terms that we set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.79,0:24:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都不要袖手旁观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No hand will stand idle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.27,0:24:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须针对未来的情况做足准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must prepare ourselves for what is to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.16,0:24:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is to come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.68,0:24:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会遇到什么事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is to happen to us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.09,0:24:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们严重缺乏武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Proper weapons are in short supply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.48,0:24:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,所以要利用木材和石头制作兵器 确保够用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fashion what you can from wood and stone, util more can be secured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.35,0:24:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,同时继续挖掘地道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would also see the tunnels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.71,0:24:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,做好撤退的准备 这也是非常必要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}beneath our feet further dug towards escape, which we will need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.52,0:24:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,再一次审视你的内心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To set eyes again upon your heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.15,0:24:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我理解了为何你当初那么不顾一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand now why a man would risk all for such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.73,0:25:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有你和大家的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it were not for you and the others,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.84,0:25:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就死在竞技场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have fallen in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.12,0:25:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这辈子再也无法一睹她的芳容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never to gaze upon her face again in this life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.45,0:25:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,大恩大德我没齿难忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a thing I will not forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.81,0:25:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,继续磨练战斗技巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}continue to hone skill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.89,0:25:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你骗我的事还没完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor the lie you told,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.40,0:25:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,任由她在那种地方受苦受罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that saw her stay in that place another fucking day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.13,0:25:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is safe now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.77,0:25:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,别的事情都不重要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All other things fall to unimportance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.45,0:25:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为动动嘴皮 发生过的事就能改变吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think a few words can change all that has happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.20,0:25:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就比我想的还要傻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand a larger fool than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.34,0:25:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,比敌人的千军万马还要可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be more dangerous than a thousand men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.68,0:25:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.02,0:25:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是我做错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mistake was mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.76,0:25:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,帮了你这个操蛋的高卢人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To offer comfort to a fucking Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.91,0:25:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮个屁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You offer shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.05,0:25:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,理智点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Regain yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.44,0:25:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.32,0:25:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为这事情过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought we had moved past this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.02,0:25:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,伤还没好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wounds still linger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.42,0:25:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去那不勒斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I move for Neapolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.26,0:26:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,找来一帮比他强百倍的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And thoughts of swelling rank with better men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.07,0:26:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人算什么啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You need not fear the Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.20,0:26:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都自相残杀起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your own men make attempt to kill each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.86,0:26:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都知道该干什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what must be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.29,0:26:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快去干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.74,0:26:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.25,0:26:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我要和你聊聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.03,0:26:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我去打仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would have me fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.53,0:26:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我是要你去打猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have you hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.30,0:26:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没人可以不劳而获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everyone has been set to purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.60,0:26:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们负责给大家找肉吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ours is to provide meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.90,0:26:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你说欠奥诺玛默斯一笔债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You spoke of a debt to Oenomaus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.25,0:26:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,难道救他一命不够还清吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was saving his life not repayment enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.46,0:26:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那得由他来决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is for him to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.18,0:26:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是自由人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a free man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.49,0:26:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以自己做主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your decisions your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.22,0:26:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,可你还是去了竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As it was when you stood in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.70,0:26:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,准备干掉自己的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To strike down your brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.85,0:26:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么下得了手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What moved your hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.27,0:26:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,为了荣誉 你有吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Honor, as you have it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.19,0:27:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还是金钱的诱惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or the promise of coin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.51,0:27:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,别站着说话不腰疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never to be collected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.84,0:27:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在竞技场上没杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because I chose not to kill you in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.24,0:27:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如今我的鲁迪斯 我的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now my rudis, my freedom,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.27,0:27:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,永远埋葬在瓦砾之下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is forever buried beneath its rubble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.72,0:27:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,自由不是什么木棍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Freedom is not a stick of wood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.75,0:27:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是赏给忠犬的骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be presented as a bone to obedient dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.80,0:27:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,自由是所有人应得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a thing all men deserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.88,0:27:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.33,0:27:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应得的只有死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deserving only death equal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.77,0:27:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就像被我们杀死的人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the lives of we have taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.29,0:27:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说不是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was not always so for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.87,0:27:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经在色雷斯自由地生活过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I lived free once, in the lands of Thrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.77,0:27:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有妻子 有子孙满堂的憧憬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With a wife, promise of children...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.96,0:27:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,后来她怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What became of her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.36,0:27:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Batiatus claimed her life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.36,0:27:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我也杀了巴蒂塔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I took his in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.97,0:28:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以现在公平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you have balanced scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.24,0:28:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,葛雷博将我们贬为奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was Glaber who condemned us to slavery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.29,0:28:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,只要他还活着 我就不会停止战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I will not rest while he yet draws breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.04,0:28:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你对抗罗马人的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the reason you provoke the Romans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.27,0:28:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为你妻子的遭遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the memory of your woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.90,0:28:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.84,0:28:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最伟大的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The greatest cause of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.26,0:28:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓的爱 毁了多少血性的汉子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that has dragged many a man to his ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.02,0:28:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你把猎物都吓跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have scared away the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.31,0:28:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是单干吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would fare better alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.89,0:29:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,剑不要放下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep fucking sword up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.30,0:29:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,放下去了 你的脑袋就掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let it drop, and fall forever beside it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.30,0:29:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.47,0:29:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不希望你热死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have you expire from the heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.71,0:29:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.26,0:29:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不希望你跟艾力冈起争执\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would also not have you at Agron's throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.36,0:29:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,照他的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he had his way,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.77,0:29:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定把你留在矿上不管了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he would have left you in the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.81,0:29:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps he was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.26,0:29:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not say such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.78,0:29:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,经过昨晚的事 你难道没这样想过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have not thought the same, after last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.19,0:29:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有这种想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If such a thought threatened,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.01,0:29:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把它从脑袋里直接挖出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would rip it from fucking brain with bare hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.75,0:29:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一重要的事情是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All that matters is the woman I love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.04,0:30:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱的女人回到身边了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}stands before me once again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.35,0:30:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.90,0:30:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,也许只是行尸走肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or is it but faint spirit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.70,0:30:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还有以前的记忆罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}haunting the memory of her body?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.96,0:30:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have lost mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.04,0:30:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,死了几百人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hundreds dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.14,0:30:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,毁了一个竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An arena destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.40,0:30:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你就提出这么一个破方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this is what you offer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.07,0:30:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,让露迪雅去市集五体投地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lucretia to prostrate herself in the market,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.50,0:30:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,祈求诸神熄灭那些还在燃烧的火焰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}begging the gods to piss out the flames that yet smolder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.85,0:30:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 赛普修斯只是太激动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, young Seppius is but moved by passionate heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.08,0:30:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神肯定已经注意到他不虔诚的信仰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure the gods take notice, of his lack of faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.64,0:30:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,在诸神面前 我们必须谦卑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must humble ourselves before the gods,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.56,0:30:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,才能重新获得他们的庇佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in attempt to regain their favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.64,0:30:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,举办仪式可以减轻民众的恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ritual will do much to ease the people's fears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.54,0:30:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到斯巴达克斯的效果更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Better assuaged by the capture of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.65,0:30:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手下扫荡城外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My men sweep the countryside,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.15,0:30:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,正是迎合祈祷的实际行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}taking action in favor of prayer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.77,0:30:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,可都好几个月了 你还是一无所获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As they have for many months, to no result.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.64,0:31:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你的人不也一样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yours have fared no better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.34,0:31:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这倒是 我们不能合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}True. The only one who benefits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.89,0:31:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,从中受益的只是我们共同的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from our divide is the man who causes us injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.30,0:31:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,结果我们都看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And most keenly felt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.90,0:31:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们深切地怀念你父亲的指导和协助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your father's guidance and even hand is deeply missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.13,0:31:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他离开人世 这些责任也就随之到头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His absence from this world has set it upon end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.53,0:31:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们的堂兄塞克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seppia fell to similar heart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.07,0:31:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,被斯巴达克斯杀死时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when our cousin Sextus was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.98,0:31:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,赛皮娅也是一样的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}snatched from life by Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.39,0:31:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,蒙卡图死的时候 她又体验到这样的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And she relives the moment in Mercato's passing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.56,0:31:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在她小的时候 蒙卡图就常来我们家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A family friend since she was yet a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.80,0:31:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去了太多朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Too many have been lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.53,0:31:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望再有贵族因此而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see no more of note to follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.09,0:31:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们抛开分歧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us set difference aside,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.90,0:31:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,集中兵力 合二为一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}join our men in common force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.54,0:32:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一定能彻底击败斯巴达克斯及其走狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One, which will overwhelm Spartacus and his murdering horde.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 为了民众的安宁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, for the good of the people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.82,0:32:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,全城都会赞颂你们两人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The city will praise you both,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.66,0:32:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的声音可以传到元老院的耳朵里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}our voices carrying to the very steps of the Senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.77,0:32:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要跟瓦里留斯商量一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would need to consult with Varinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.61,0:32:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙还没等竞技场完全坍塌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The very same man who galloped back to Rome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.41,0:32:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就已经屁滚尿流地逃回罗马了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while the stones of the arena were yet falling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.77,0:32:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯只想摆脱麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varinius moves to distance himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.48,0:32:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,根本不管这里发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from all that has happened here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.16,0:32:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也不管你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Including you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.12,0:32:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,来握手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take my hand,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.37,0:32:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的联盟是坚不可摧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and with it see more lasting bond forged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.06,0:32:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我会考虑你的提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will consider your proposal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.83,0:32:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,明天给你答复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To give answer tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.50,0:32:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,休息一晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A night's rest, ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.49,0:32:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,别人没办法 他可爱的妹妹也许行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loving sister may sway a brother, where others fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.78,0:32:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,到早上就能决定下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}...mind to be certainly cleared by morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.33,0:32:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,赛普修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seppius,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.65,0:32:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我想邀请你妹妹来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would extend invitation to your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.62,0:33:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,两颗受伤的心相互安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In hopes that we may find greater strength{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.10,0:33:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,也许可以获得一点力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the beating of two wounded hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.32,0:33:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thoughtful offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.53,0:33:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对女人来说 同是女人来安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no deeper solace for a woman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.70,0:33:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,效果是再好不过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than in the bosom of her gender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.97,0:33:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那应该会让她感到安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would come as great comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.06,0:33:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.99,0:33:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我会安排的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will arrange visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.10,0:33:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你妻子的脑袋很灵活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife speaks with swift thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.76,0:33:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事情赛皮娅和你们有同感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seppia will take words to heart on the matter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.74,0:33:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,而赛普修斯更听得进去她的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with Seppius to find them better received from her lips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.00,0:33:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.03,0:33:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你的邀请也许很有帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your invitation may yet prove to be welcomed aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.92,0:33:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 我还有别的事情要跟你商量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come. I would discuss other matters with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.99,0:33:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是告诉过你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did I not tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.34,0:34:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们总有一天可以再爬起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Together we will see ourselves freed from this abyss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.94,0:34:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我连人影都没看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not see the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.29,0:34:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定他还活着吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are certain he lives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.24,0:34:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经有四个人跟他一起待在下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There were four others held with him at the bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.14,0:34:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他不太喜欢跟别人一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He did not care for the company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.55,0:34:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就在皮肉上刻了他们的印记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their memory is carved into his flesh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.72,0:34:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,以前他杀了人都把印记刻在自己的身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}joining the marks of the other souls that he has taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.19,0:34:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要找这种怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it you seek of such a beast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.76,0:34:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我找这个埃及人的原因不关你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What I seek of the Egyptian is none of your concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.04,0:34:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我奉民政官盖尤斯•克罗迪斯•葛雷博的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I come under the authority of Praetor Gaius Claudius Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.40,0:34:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是大人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A noble title.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.85,0:34:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 除非民政官本人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet absent the man himself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.83,0:34:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我无权放人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot break my charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.94,0:34:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.20,0:34:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你不介意跟这些人在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you do not mind waiting here with my men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.26,0:35:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等我带他回来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until I return with him...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.30,0:35:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的天气太热了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well the day has been long and hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.51,0:35:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我去乘个凉 再喝点酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have shade, and wine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.72,0:35:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,降降火气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to cool overheating concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.89,0:35:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,弃暗投明吧 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see you into the light, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.74,0:35:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,为我们效力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And set hands to purpose...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.83,0:35:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,左臂要保持稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must keep your left arm steady,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.18,0:35:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一直拉至脸颊 呼吸 放箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}pull through to the cheek, take breath, and release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.41,0:36:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,试试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.51,0:36:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,一直拉至脸颊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pull through to cheek...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.09,0:36:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deep breath...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.50,0:36:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,放箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.61,0:36:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要猛拉弓弦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not jerk from the string.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.44,0:36:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,要从指间轻柔地滑出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But let it gently slip from your fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.73,0:36:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,多加练习 你就能像女神戴安娜一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With practice, you will be as the goddess Diana,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.10,0:36:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,从远处杀敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}striking enemies from afar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.54,0:36:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,多纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Donar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.18,0:36:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟你一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would accompany you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.98,0:36:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我对射箭没兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hold no interest in the bow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.50,0:36:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,睡了一次你就指望咱俩永远不分开吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We lay together once and you expect us to never be parted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.64,0:36:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我是他妈的高卢人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mistake me for a fucking Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.92,0:36:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在又想跟着多纳了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You seek Donar's affection now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.93,0:36:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想能找到一席之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I seek only my place in this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.59,0:36:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这要靠你的双手去争取\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then seize it with your own hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.21,0:37:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是靠张开你的大腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not by the spreading of your legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.18,0:37:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,两周内 这里会停靠一艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In two weeks time, a ship will dock here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.32,0:37:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,船上载满了被罗马人抓住的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Its hold laden with fighting men captured by the Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.00,0:37:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们几个乔装成商人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If a few of us dressed as merchants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.90,0:37:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就能在他们下船之前进去…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}could gain entry, before they're unloaded...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.71,0:37:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这方法可行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such a thing is possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.78,0:37:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你的努力没有白费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your labors have born fruit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.22,0:37:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也不全是好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not all as sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.13,0:37:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,街头巷尾到处都是流言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}News carries through the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.51,0:37:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,葛雷博悬赏九千第纳尔要你的人头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber has raised the bounty on your head to 9000 denarii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.14,0:37:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你一无所获 只抓住了罗马人的注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems you have caught nothing but Rome's attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.34,0:37:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿可不太好吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will find that a sour meal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.35,0:37:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,高卢人还他妈的不够坏吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Were the Gauls not fucking bad enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.47,0:37:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说了很多传说 说你是不败的高卢人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have heard many tales of the Undefeated Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.85,0:37:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,称号不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fine title.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.94,0:37:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我想起了那次你没获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I recall you absent victory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.91,0:38:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那场我们跟索罗尼斯的人在竞技场的开幕战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when we faced Solonius' men in the opening of the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.88,0:38:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}True.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.30,0:38:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我没有获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was not awarded victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.93,0:38:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不过正式的挑战赛中也没失败过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I did not suffer defeat in proper challenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.71,0:38:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们很快就要失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps we will yet have one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.63,0:38:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.47,0:38:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你当过冠军 我很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It warms heart to know that you were champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.55,0:38:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,说明你很渴望冠军的称谓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show how much you desired it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.24,0:38:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不过在这儿看到你 实在是出乎意料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet it comes as a surprise, to see you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.60,0:38:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着那个色雷斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Following a Thracian's lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.72,0:38:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯开了我的眼界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus has opened my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.14,0:38:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们同生共死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We stand together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.84,0:38:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那你怎么还坐在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then why do you now sit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.08,0:38:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,任凭他跟那个呆子商量行动计划呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while he and the lumbering oaf make plans that affect all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.09,0:38:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我有别的事情要想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am taken by other concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.54,0:38:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅是你的女人了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia is your woman now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.74,0:38:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得她那时还是含苞待放的姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remember her, when she was yet a flower untouched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.98,0:39:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么受到了那么严重的摧残\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What led her to be so rudely handled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.40,0:39:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我对她的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My affections.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.42,0:39:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还有发现了秘密的露迪雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And discovery of them by Lucretia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.68,0:39:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所爱的人总是付出最沉重的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The heaviest price is always paid by those we love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.95,0:39:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该带她远离斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should carry her far from Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.56,0:39:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟着他搅和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his foolish cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.96,0:39:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他迟早带你们走到绝路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before he drags you all to your end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.40,0:39:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenomaus awakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.85,0:39:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想跟你说两句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am here only for words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.62,0:39:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在说什么还有意义吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which do you think could ever hold meaning now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.09,0:39:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,梅莉塔选择了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That Melitta chose you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.45,0:39:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人当中她最珍视你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That your heart was cherished above all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.98,0:40:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么她死的那天你和她在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then why was she with you the night she died?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.92,0:40:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,为了在我被卖给图利乌斯前喝最后一杯酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To share a final drink before I was to be sold to Tullius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.70,0:40:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这个原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only reason?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.62,0:40:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,无论我们发生了什么 责任在我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever happened between us, I am to blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.87,0:40:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.52,0:40:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我当你是亲兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I loved you as a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.86,0:40:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.16,0:40:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.22,0:40:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你是一个自私自利的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a man that stands only for himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.10,0:40:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为了满足你的欲望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And would betray the gods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.22,0:40:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你连诸神也能背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to gain what he desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.74,0:40:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我那时太傻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps I was a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.79,0:40:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,信奉的是另外一套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To have ever believed otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.40,0:41:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我每次闭眼都能看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see it every time I close my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.25,0:41:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯掷出的长矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus, hurling his spear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.87,0:41:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,科萨特斯最后吐出一口气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cossutius' final gasping breath...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.85,0:41:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,还有蒙卡图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Mercato...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.82,0:41:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的蒙卡图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor Mercato...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.33,0:41:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都很想念他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will be sorely missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.63,0:41:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.03,0:41:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我这样喋喋不休 就好像只有我失去过亲人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I babble on as if I am the only one that has suffered loss,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.16,0:41:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而你还在失去父亲的悲痛之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you grieve a father's passing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.77,0:41:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我满脑子想的都是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The heart is overwhelmed by his absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.22,0:41:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们会重逢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shall embrace him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.46,0:41:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我和蒙卡图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I shall Mercato,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.13,0:41:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还有堂兄塞克斯也是一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and beloved cousin Sextus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.05,0:41:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,在往生世界的岸边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Upon the shores of the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.87,0:41:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我的丈夫昆图斯还在耐心地等着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where my husband Quintus patiently awaits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.33,0:41:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还有很多有身份有地位的罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And with him countless other Romans of note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.34,0:42:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们共同的敌人就这样夺走了他们的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All snatched from this life too soon, by common foe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.29,0:42:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两人都比我年长多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The years between you far outweigh mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.08,0:42:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但别把我想得那么幼稚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet do not think me naive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.62,0:42:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是为了寻求安慰而请我过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You extend invitation not to counsel grief,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.73,0:42:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,只是利用我说服我的哥哥罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but to maneuver me to sway my brother's position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.86,0:42:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,赛皮娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seppia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.70,0:42:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他的想法再清楚不过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's been clear in his desire that he,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.81,0:42:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他要单枪匹马制服我们共同的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he alone will bring our common foe to justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.89,0:42:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他这人下定决心就很难动摇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And his passions when set are not easily moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.87,0:42:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你揭穿了两个老妇人的阴谋诡计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have uncovered the veiled schemes of two old women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.72,0:42:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但你要理解这种想法来自于受伤的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But know attempt springs from wounded heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.62,0:42:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,年龄和经验都无所谓 我们同病相怜是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One shared between us all, regardless of age or experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.31,0:42:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯站在场上时 我看到了他的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I looked into his eyes, when Spartacus stood down upon the sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.10,0:42:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他眼中的怒火似乎要吞噬全世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They burned with a fire that would consume the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.14,0:42:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it shall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.20,0:43:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果好人不能抛开分歧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If good men fail to set quarrel aside,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.41,0:43:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,共同面对斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and face Spartacus as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.42,0:43:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我跟你妻子说的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I have said to your wife,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.06,0:43:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我哥哥是很难被说服的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my brother can be most difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.27,0:43:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不是他一个人的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Faults is not his alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.30,0:43:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾我没有选择更好的解决方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I regret not having taken different path towards more agreeable solution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.76,0:43:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但你要知道我现在是诚心诚意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But know that I place foot firmly upon it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.74,0:43:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我自当进言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will have words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.58,0:43:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,尽我所能让他站到你这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And attempt to set him upon it beside you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.30,0:43:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,多好的事儿啊 对吧 盖尤斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Most welcomed news, is it not, Gaius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.80,0:43:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 真是好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, most welcomed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.80,0:43:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,近来这宅子阴云密布 有你在真是蓬荜生辉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a ray of light, in a house mired in shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.38,0:43:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.14,0:43:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有急事要办 恕我失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pressing matters call my attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.78,0:44:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你真幸运 有这么好的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're blessed, to hold such a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.90,0:44:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,该是你的自然跑不掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods grant only what is deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.46,0:44:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你要的人都已经召集齐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The men required have been assembled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.06,0:44:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.77,0:44:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我要看看他们有没有你说的那么厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see if they are all that you've promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.99,0:44:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯打来的猎物做好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus' bounty is being prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.18,0:44:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们吃点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, let us take food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.11,0:44:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你磨得好锋利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have honed it to fine edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.84,0:44:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,只要切开皮肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Life would easily run from veins,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.79,0:44:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易就能死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if brought to bear upon flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.99,0:44:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.12,0:44:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这个名字已经没有意义了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is a name that holds no meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.92,0:44:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她曾经那么年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was a different girl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.31,0:45:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那么天真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}young and foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.80,0:45:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,却让那些粗糙的手 粗重的喘息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ripped from this world by rough hands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.94,0:45:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,夺走了这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and hot breath upon neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.07,0:45:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,为了活下去 她只能面对这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The things she was forced to do to survive...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.90,0:45:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will go from this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.49,0:45:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,远走高飞 开始新的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Find a new life on distant shores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.09,0:45:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,远远地离开罗马的阴影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beyond the shadow of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.63,0:45:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,无论去哪里 都抹不去那些记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no place that memory would not follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.22,0:45:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我摆脱不掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot run from this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.61,0:45:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底要我怎样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would you have me do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.43,0:45:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睁睁地看着你憔悴至死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand idle, and watch as you fade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.62,0:45:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不要你这样看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I would not have you watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.46,0:46:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你教教我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have you teach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.98,0:46:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如何获得新生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How to breathe again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.97,0:46:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如何活命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.45,0:46:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如何战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.73,0:46:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就再也没有人敢欺负我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that no man will ever lay hands on me against my will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.16,0:46:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等到那时 我才能重新拥有那个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the girl who's name was robbed may reclaim it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.78,0:46:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要让恶贯满盈的罗马人付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will have vengeance for what the Romans have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.94,0:46:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要让他们血流成河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Together we shall see them drown in rivers of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.61,0:46:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.20,0:46:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.16,0:46:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,保持镇定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Calm yourselves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.71,0:46:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,慌慌张张的干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What moves to such fits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.80,0:46:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的钱全都不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our remaining coin is missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.66,0:46:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,钱算个屁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck the coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.43,0:46:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,地图不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The map is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.49,0:46:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的方位 攻打那不勒斯的计划…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our position, plans towards Neapolis...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.44,0:46:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有人为了拿到葛雷博的赏金 背叛了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Someone seeks to betray us, for promise of Glaber's reward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.43,0:46:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.79,0:47:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.99,0:47:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你一句话不说就要走了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You leave without words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.02,0:47:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,该说的我都跟奥诺玛默斯说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have had them with Oenomaus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.95,0:47:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你身上带了什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you carry with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.79,0:47:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.17,0:47:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还有肉 是我亲手打来的猎物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Meat, caught by my own fucking hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.40,0:47:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的地图不翼而飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our map takes flight in your wake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.37,0:47:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你当时看到过那个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing I have seen your gaze upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.26,0:47:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我是干过不少坏事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am guilty of many things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.06,0:47:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,出卖你们的狗屁计划可不在其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Betraying ill-fated cause does not stand among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.67,0:47:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还不给老子让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remove yourself from fucking path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.07,0:47:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就知道你要带着他们送死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I knew eventually you would lead these men to their deaths eventually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.99,0:47:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,莫非你今天就等不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this the day you would do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.00,0:47:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都很忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are but loyal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.83,0:48:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎正是你缺少的品质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A quality you seem unfamiliar with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.87,0:48:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.55,0:48:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不要挡在我们中间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not come between us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.70,0:48:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让他瞧瞧 胸怀大志的人有多大本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would show him what a man with cause is capable of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.66,0:48:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,把剑给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.36,0:48:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你是双剑角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fight in the style of Dimachaerus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.99,0:48:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯亲自训练的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trained by Oenomaus himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.72,0:48:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,放我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.55,0:48:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,否则就试试你的能耐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or put skill to final test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.12,0:49:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不能打下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must stop this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.79,0:49:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这是斯巴达克斯的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus has made desire known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.89,0:49:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall honor it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.68,0:49:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.45,0:50:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,夏达娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Chadara!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.91,0:50:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她想偷偷溜走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was trying to slip away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.94,0:50:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,趁着大家都没有注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When all others stood fixed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.89,0:50:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好箭法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fine shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.91,0:50:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想射伤她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I meant only to wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.66,0:50:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,她偷了地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She took the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.00,0:50:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,她为什么要这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why would she do such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.93,0:50:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她觉得在我们中间没有地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She felt she had no place among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.16,0:50:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,希望到别的地方寻求认可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She sought to secure one elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.21,0:50:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.10,0:50:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你说的是真话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your words prove true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.30,0:50:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不是次次都能证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has not always been so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.10,0:51:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would take to path now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.38,0:51:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你还要跟我打下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unless you would seek further quarrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.57,0:51:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.96,0:51:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们流的血够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enough blood has spilled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.17,0:51:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你不走吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.10,0:51:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.72,0:51:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就等着为你哀悼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I shall mourn your passing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.80,0:51:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这样放走他行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it wise to let him go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.22,0:51:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都有权利作出选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every man has a right to his own choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.91,0:51:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯作出了他的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus has made his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.92,0:51:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他是我们的隐患\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And may yet prove a threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.24,0:51:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,更坏的情况我们都经历过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have faced far worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.92,0:52:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,埃及人他们确实有些能耐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Egyptian and your men prove themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.73,0:52:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,说到做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.32,0:52:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好好处理这些奴隶的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See the bodies of the slaves properly attended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.58,0:52:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不要惹人注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Draw no attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.34,0:53:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.19,0:53:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想等到早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not wait until morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.87,0:53:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你要接受我的提议吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wish to give voice to my offer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.83,0:53:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕为时已晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear it comes too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.89,0:53:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,赛皮娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}S-S-Seppia...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.08,0:53:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道她对你有多么重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've seen how close you hold her to heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.19,0:53:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你就放心地走吧 她很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave this life knowing she's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.61,0:53:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有我罩着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beneath my roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.12,0:53:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我亲手安慰她受伤的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My hands to comfort her in days to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.45,0:53:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么都没有意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Words no longer hold meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.54,0:53:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我的耳朵早就起茧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I've had too many of them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.84,0:53:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那些自以为高高在上的傻瓜废话太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by fools presuming themselves to be my better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.42,0:53:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这种日子到头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such days are at an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.82,0:53:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你的军队归我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your men are now mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.49,0:54:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有了他们的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And with their addition to my own,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.46,0:54:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的末日就要到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}clear path to the end of Spartacus.{\r}
